data symbol_index_fill_invocation_frequency_note: String = "INVOCATION FREQUENCY (traced 2026-07-13): namespace_for_subject is the sole callsite of symbol_index_fill_module_roots (03_name_resolve.dag:534). namespace_for_subject is called only from resolve_with_admission_policy (:569). That is called only from resolve_with_admission / resolve_with_admission_grounded, each forwarding default_name_resolution_policy(). Upstream: assemble_program_from_ingest / assemble_program_from_module_roots (ONE resolve per ingest assembly over all validated_roots), compile_ingest_with_admission / compile_source_root_ingest_with_admission (ONE resolve per compile entry), plus isolated claim tests. No per-module loop re-fills all roots: cost is O(N_total) per top-level resolve, NOT O(M·N_total). v1 CI floor (whole_tree_resolved_ctx) does NOT exercise this v2 fill path yet."

